  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nNow that the internet is decades old, there are many legacy sites with historical knowledge that is outdated. But search engines and LLMs present the old information along with more current information equally. \n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\nThe most basic solution is to remove content from the internet but then we lose the historical record.\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\nMaybe something like <meta deprecated=\"true\"> , or <meta name=\"deprecated\" content=\"historical\"> could indicate that this information is for historical records only.\n\n### Anything else?\n\n_No response_",
